        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p>This resolution authorizes up to&nbsp;$10,740,218&nbsp;for the expenses of the House Select Committee on the Strategic Competition between the United States and the Chinese Communist Party for the 119th Congress.&nbsp;</p><p>The resolution makes $5,366,830 available during the first session of the 119th Congress&nbsp;and up to $5,373,388&nbsp;during the second session of the 119th Congress. </p>",
